{"title": "[Brand] Portable Smoothie Blender 350ml Tritan Cup, USB-C Rechargeable", "bullets": ["BLEND ANYWHERE: This compact personal blender holds 350 ml (about 11.8 oz), enough for a single smoothie, protein shake, or juice. It fits easily in a gym bag, backpack, or desk drawer, so you can blend at work, at the gym, or on the road.", "USB-C CHARGING: The built-in 2000mAh rechargeable battery charges through USB-C, so you can use the same cable as many phones and laptops. Plug it into a wall adapter, power bank, or computer and skip the extra charger.", "ABOUT 12 BLENDS PER CHARGE: In-house factory testing showed about 12 blending cycles on a full charge. Your results may vary with ingredients and usage, but one charge can cover several days of morning shakes.", "ONE-BUTTON OPERATION: There are no settings to fiddle with. Add your ingredients, press the single button, and the 6 stainless steel blades blend your drink. The cup doubles as your drinking cup, so there is less to wash afterward.", "SAFETY LOCK WHEN DETACHED: The blender will not run when the cup is separated from the base. This helps prevent accidental starts while you are filling, emptying, or cleaning it."], "description": "Make fresh smoothies, shakes, and juices wherever your day takes you. This portable blender pairs a 350 ml Tritan cup with 6 stainless steel blades and a 2000mAh rechargeable battery, so you can blend a single serving without a full-size countertop appliance.

It is easy to use. Charge it with any USB-C cable, add your ingredients, and press the one button to start. In-house factory testing showed about 12 blends per full charge; actual results depend on what you blend and how long you run it. A built-in safety lock keeps the motor from running when the cup is detached from the base.

Its compact size works for the office, gym, travel, and dorm rooms. Blend, then drink straight from the cup and rinse.", "search_terms": "personal blender mini juicer cup travel shake mixer protein shaker electric smoothie maker cordless juice bottle gym office dorm fruit mixer single serve rechargeable small", "notes_zh": "标题按 AMZ-01 控制在 71 字符以内，未用促销话术或违禁符号。续航 12 次已注明为工厂内部测试。产品没有 UL/ETL/FCC 认证，文中未提及任何美国认证。BPA-free 只有材料供应商声明、没有成品第三方报告，因此未写入。是否需要 Prop 65 警示须由供应商检测资料确认，上架前请核实。"}
